# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is public.
# Git ignores EVERYTHING in this folder by default.  Only the files
# listed under "Allowed" are ever committed.  To publish a new file
# or folder, add it to that list on purpose.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Ignore everything at the top level of the folder
/*

# Allowed: the live site and the repo's own settings files
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/index.html
!/CNAME

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Second layer: never commit these anywhere, even inside a folder
# that is later added to the allowed list.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Claude Code project files (local rules, settings, notes)
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/

# Drop-off and scratch folders
Incoming/
private/
drafts/

# Office lock files and temp files
~$*
*.tmp
*.bak

# OS clutter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
